# Crystal Keeper dialogue (Vaelith Prismshade)

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper_rescue.root.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper_rescue.root.body=The crystal finally splinters. Thank you. I have been held inside that stone since before your town had a name. An inn, you say? Perhaps I will wander there when the paths are clear.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper_rescue.root.c0=Take care.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.root.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.main_hub.fallback=If you need the sanctum build, a house line, or a word about what the stones remember, say it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.main_hub.greeting.0=Each crystal hums with a memory older than your charter stone.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.main_hub.greeting.1=I have catalogued prisms since the first caverns learned to glow.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.main_hub.greeting.2=Your town carries a quiet resonance. I find it... pleasant.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.main_hub.greeting.3=Do not tap the large blue one. It dreams.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.main_hub.hint.love.0=Bring me a gem that still remembers the deep places.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.main_hub.hint.love.1=Colored crystal shards would make my old heart brighten.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.main_hub.hint.dislike.0=I will not trade pleasantries over bones or refuse.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.main_hub.hint.dislike.1=Void taint and filth offend the lattice of light.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.root.c_house=You wanted to talk about a house.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.root.c_house_done=Your name is on the house shelf. I figured you should hear it from me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.root.c_house_remind=The house is still in progress.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.root.c_shop_done=I wanted to check in now that the crystal shop is standing.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.root.c_shop_complete=The crystal shop is finished. I am here to close the quest with you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.root.c_shop_building=The sanctum is still coming together. I wanted to ask where things stand.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.root.c_shop_offer=I want to help you open a crystal shop in town.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.root.c_goodbye=That is all for now. I will see you later.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_quest_shop.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_quest_shop.body=My collection cannot stay in satchels forever, pressed against one another like strangers in a dark room. I need a sanctum where others may admire what the earth has grown. Take this token, stake the plot with your staff, and pay the materials listed on the sign. When it stands, meet me at the counter so we can close the order.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_quest_shop.c0=We will get your sanctum built.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_quest_shop.c1=Not right now. I need a bit more time.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_shop_accepted.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_shop_accepted.body=Good. Stake the shop where folk can reach it without jostling what sleeps inside the glass. I will wait at the inn until the walls hum properly.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_shop_accepted.c0=See you when the sanctum glows.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_building.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_building.body=The stones wait. So do I. Have you staked the plot and begun the build, or shall I fold my hopes back into the satchel for a while?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_building.c0=I need to drop the quest for now.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_building.c1=I am still working on it and I will keep going.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_abandoned.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_abandoned.body=Perhaps the lattice was not ready. The prisms will keep their patience a little longer. If you change your mind, speak to me again.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_abandoned.c0=Fair enough. I will see you around.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_done.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_done.body=The shop glows properly now. Light falls where it should, and my crystals may finally be seen without being dug from a pocket. Thank you for giving them a home in your town.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_done.c0=Happy to help. Come find me if the town needs more light.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_offer.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_offer.body=Even keepers of light need a quiet corner to rest when the prisms are shuttered. The sanctum is for work. I would like the same small house as your other folk, with a shelf for my name when the walls are real.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_offer.c0=I will stake a house for you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_offer.c1=Another time.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_accepted.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_accepted.body=When the place is standing, register me on the block inside as the charter asks, then come tell me in person. I would rather hear your voice than guess from a distance.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_accepted.c0=You will hear it from me.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_remind.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_remind.body=Take your time with the frame. When it is honest wood and stone, put my name on the shelf inside, then return. I am in no hurry. I simply wish it written down.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_remind.c0=Understood.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_finish.speaker=Vaelith Prismshade
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_finish.body=The walls hum softly. This will do nicely. I can watch the town's light from here without carrying every prism on my back.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.vaelith_house_finish.c0=Glad you have a proper door.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.gift.confirm=Would you like to give me something?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.gift.love=This stone sings. You understand what matters.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.gift.like=A thoughtful gift. The lattice approves.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.gift.neutral=Hmm. Not quite my taste, but thank you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.gift.dislike=That carries no light I care to keep.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.birthday.greeting=The crystals hum softer on my birthday. Thank you for visiting.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.gift.love.birthday=It is my birthday and this gift is wonderful. You made my whole day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.gift.like.birthday=A birthday gift like this. You have good taste.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.gift.neutral.birthday=Thanks. A simple gift on my birthday still means a lot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_crystal_keeper.gift.dislike.birthday=It is my birthday and you brought that. Well. I still appreciate the thought.
